=== Prompt ===
Who is Pikachu?

=== Response ===
Pikachu is a beloved and iconic fictional creature from the popular media franchise 'Pokémon'. It is a small, rodent-like Pokémon with electric powers and is known for being the mascot of the franchise.

Pikachu is a yellow, mouse-like creature with red circles on its cheeks, which store electricity. It is one of the most recognizable and beloved Pokémon, and it has become a cultural icon around the world. Pikachu is often depicted as a loyal and friendly companion to the main character, Ash Ketchum, in the Pokémon anime series.

Pikachu is also known for its adorable appearance, its cute expressions, and its adorable voice. In the Pokémon games, Pikachu is a popular choice among players due to its high attack power and its ability to learn powerful electric-type moves.

Overall, Pikachu is a beloved and iconic character in the world of Pokémon, and it continues to be a popular and beloved character among fans of all ages.

